# MirrorMessiah: fill missing movie subtitles until OpenSubtitles daily quota is used.
# Install: crontab -e and paste one line below (adjust paths).
#
# Runs at 03:15 every day; logs append to logs/fetch-subs.log in the repo.
#
# 15 3 * * * /path/to/mirrormessiah/scripts/fetch-subs-daily.sh
#
# Optional env (add before the command or in the script):
#   MM_FETCH_SUBS_LANG=es
#   MM_FETCH_SUBS_LOG=/var/log/mirrormessiah-fetch-subs.log
#
# Requires in .env: OPENSUBS_USERNAME, OPENSUBS_PASSWORD
